# Store every tracked file exactly as it is on disk — no line-ending translation.
#
# This repository is the release-gate baseline: byte-exact checks run against it
# (SHA256 manifests, check-feature-parity, any diff-based gate). Git for Windows
# sets core.autocrlf=true from system config, so without this line a fresh clone
# or `reset --hard` rewrites every script to CRLF and those checks report a
# CONTENT mismatch for an environmental reason. Byte-for-byte is the whole point.
* -text
